.com/a/7oOFIkl).  She's a very tough and strong girl who speaks similarly to delinquent or sukeban anime characters like 纏 流子, 空条 徐倫, 上運天 美羅... etc. Her voice is somewhat deep. She is a character in a game where the protagonist is only 0.5 cm tall.  And she's forced to look after them often, and while she may seem mean, she really cares for those who are close to her\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n【Request information】\n①\n「はあぁ？何ジロジロ見てんだ、お前。あー……なんだ、お前か。」\n\n②\n「オレはリュウカ！邪魔すんなよ、踏み潰されてぇのか？」\n\n➂\n「チビの世話とかめんどくせぇなぁ。ほら、靴ん中入って黙ってろ。ちょぉ～～～～うるせぇんだよ！！」\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nThank you! I hope there are no mistakes. Feel free to adlib, remove, or add lines as you see fit if you think it'll improve the request. Your voice is really awesome!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/7oOFIkl", "nc": 136, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ichienyade/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1964992487837298688%2F6DG0F8_z.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d9ceed8996deb0bf9cdcdf81eeefc1de", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1964992487837298688%2F6DG0F8_z.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d9ceed8996deb0bf9cdcdf81eeefc1de, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1964992487837298688%2F6DG0F8_z.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=31891f52864492f4f0ccdbd6891f0eb1 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1964992487837298688%2F6DG0F8_z.jpg?bg=%23fff&aut